not itself grant, imply, or estop the assertion of trademark rights.

11.6. Secondary Licenses

The initial Contributor attaches the notice in Exhibit B to all Covered
Software. The Covered Software is Incompatible With Secondary Licenses
as defined in Section 1.5, and Section 3.3 does not permit distribution
of the Covered Software under the terms of any Secondary License.

11.7. AI Coding Agent Guidance

The license steward may publish guidance describing requested practices
for AI coding agents and their operators (for example, the file
